Rule 3 (avoid unsupported half precision on some devices)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 6
>>
Rule 4 (batch dimensions, if any, must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
